      "value": "<p> Phalangeal finger bones crackle and tendons creak as your hand becomes your foe’s chew toy or miniature punching bag.</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> Your hand is useless (see under Amputated Parts) for the rest of the encounter. Afterward it’ll be swollen and battered enough to count as a Torn Muscle (Minor).</p>"
